# Brand assets licence

The code in this repository is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later (see `/LICENSE`). **The brand assets are not covered by it.**

The brand assets are:
- the Lodestar name used as a product name;
- the logo lockups, wordmark and compass star;
- the mascot and the illustrated scenes;
- the icons and favicons.

They include everything in `brand/` and every file the build derives from them (for example the processed images under `web/`).

All rights to these assets are reserved by the project owner, with one permission. You may use them **unmodified** to refer to Lodestar, for example in an article, a package listing or a link to this project.

If you distribute a modified version of Lodestar, the AGPL lets you share the code, but please give it a different name and replace these assets. Then nobody mistakes your version for this one.

